    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "CHANEL has just unveiled its Fall/Winter 2026 collection, inspired by the philosophy of metamorphosis — \"from caterpillar to butterfly.\" This season's handbags are adorned with three-dimensional enamel flowers, tropical foliage, birds, and fish, or crafted with sequin embroidery, fur marquetry, and beadwork to create dazzling butterfly-wing textures, capturing the allure of the \"night butterfly.\"",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "By day a caterpillar, by night a butterfly. — Gabrielle Chanel",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
